@startuml 04-Register
title Luồng 4: Đăng ký tài khoản mới

actor "Khách" as G4
participant "Modal\nĐăng ký" as Modal4
participant "auth.js" as AuthJS4
participant "Flask\n(auth.py)" as Flask4
participant "DB\n(SQLAlchemy)" as DB4

G4 -> Modal4: Điền form đăng ký\n(username, email, password, confirm)
G4 -> Modal4: Bấm "Đăng ký"

Modal4 -> AuthJS4: submit event → fetch()
AuthJS4 -> Flask4: POST /auth/register\n{ username, email, password, confirm_password }

Flask4 -> Flask4: Validation:\n- username >= 3 ký tự\n- password >= 6 ký tự\n- confirm match

Flask4 -> DB4: User.query.filter_by(username=...).first()
DB4 --> Flask4: None (chưa tồn tại)

Flask4 -> DB4: User.query.filter_by(email=...).first()
DB4 --> Flask4: None (chưa tồn tại)

Flask4 -> Flask4: user = User(username, email)\nuser.set_password(password)

Flask4 -> DB4: db.session.add(user)
DB4 -> DB4: INSERT INTO user
Flask4 -> DB4: db.session.commit()

Flask4 -> Flask4: login_user(user, remember=True)

Flask4 --> AuthJS4: JSON { success: true, redirect: '/' }
AuthJS4 -> AuthJS4: window.location.href = '/'

note over G4: Người dùng được chuyển về trang chủ\nvới trạng thái đã đăng nhập

@enduml